The data files in this repository — the synthetic persona seeds (data/seeds/),
the meta-analytic anchor audit trail (data/anchors/), the generated narrative
corpora and model ratings (results/generation/), and all derived result tables
(results/) — are released under CC BY 4.0. You may share and adapt them for any
purpose, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Attribution: Vaid, S. S., & Whillans, A. V. (2026). Benchmarking Psychological
Dynamics in Generative Agents. AI Measurement Science Workshop at COLM 2026.

Code in this repository is licensed separately under the MIT License (see
LICENSE at the repository root).

Note on the anchor library: the meta-analytic effect sizes in
scripts/validation/meta_analysis_validation.py and data/seeds/ are numeric
values transcribed from the cited published meta-analyses, with citations.
The source publications themselves are not redistributed.
